   "text": "University of Plymouth - Foundation - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nUniversity of Plymouth - Foundation\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nPlymouth University was originally founded as the Plymouth School of Navigation in 1862 and is located in the picturesque South West of England. The university scores well in law, psychology, geographical sciences, computing (including digital media) and computer science, fine art and art history and the University of Plymouth ranks 503rd in the CWUR World University Rankings 2017. In The Times and Sunday Times University League Table 2018, the University of Plymouth's world ranking was listed as joint 701st and 601–650 in QS World University Rankings 2019.\nThe International College provides foundation, first year and pre-Masters programs which lead to a wide range of undergraduate (Bachelors) and postgraduate (Masters) degrees at the University of Plymouth.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n05/05/2026 06:25\nby Eston Dalmeida\nCreated\n27/03/2026 08:50\nby Eston Dalmeida\nType\nPathway\nCountry\nUnited Kingdom\nYearly Fees\nMax: £15,844.00\nMin: £8,402.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n12%\n2,350 of 19,000 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPublic\nProvider\nNAVITAS\nFounded Year\n1862\nCampus(es)\nPlymouth\nCountry\nUnited Kingdom\nExcluded Countries\nAustralia, Cuba, Iran, North Korea, Syria, United States\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n26/03/2026\nContract End Date\n01/04/2029\nContract Entity\nQS Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nAccommodation available\nScholarship Offered\n-\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=U75DtFXDEkU\nInternship Details\n-\nAdditional Information\n-",
